{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id683069967"}, "name":{"label":"Messa2015"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-20T15:20:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.93.0"}, "id":{"label":"14452482826"}, "title":{"label":"Premium Subscription Required?"}, "content":{"label":"TLDR: You have to pay the upgrade to delete water. I think that’s stupid! \nI think it is beyond ridiculous that in order to fix mistakes you have to have the paid plan. I am far too haphazard and easily make mistakes when imputing measures especially when the app is not intuitively designed for editing things such as smaller water vessels. The need for a paid subscription to delete accidental entries is almost enough to make me delete the app. Because I see the data is incorrect and and feel the need to accurately reflect but the accurate reflection is hard to obtain due to needing to drink more water to match what the app says but unable to accurately measure as I do not have access to the vessel needed for equal measurement to rectify the difference so I am likely to just say forget it and delete the app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
