{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1634813501"}, "name":{"label":"bear-bear🐻🐻"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-19T07:25:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.93.0"}, "id":{"label":"14447029884"}, "title":{"label":"I love it!"}, "content":{"label":"First of all, I would like to see that I’d love this app. The whole concept is just amazing! It’s cute, the widgets are helpful, and I got a good deal on the lifetime subscription! I have a few notes that I would like to point out. First of all I have an Apple Watch and absolutely love it. When I got this app it said that I would only get the app on my watch if I paid for it, however I got it right away. I just couldn’t log extra drinks so I think that needs to be changed or updated. My only other comment is sometimes I find it hard to continuously log. In general, I love this app. I also have Mindllama and Foodllama and I love how you can get the little characters for the other apps! Also, sometimes I wish there was a  teen setting because some of the challenges don’t apply to teens. In general, this app is amazing and I would totally recommend it!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
